# Files Wrangler must not publish (gitignore syntax).
#
# The assets directory is the repository root, so without this the whole repo is served,
# .git included: anyone could fetch /.git/config and rebuild the history. Only the site
# itself should go up. Keep _headers: Cloudflare reads it from here for the cache and
# security headers, and never serves it as a file.
.git
.github
.claude
.gitignore
.editorconfig
.assetsignore
node_modules
scripts
README.md
package.json
package-lock.json
netlify.toml
wrangler.jsonc
